 "about": "A sword attack that really hits: a normal skill (animation 1001, a sword in the hand) whose graph triggers the official sector hit box 250 ms into the swing. In front of the start stand a crate (an object with a hurt box and loot) and a creature (with loot). The script swings five times: the crate breaks at the first hit, the creature falls at the second or third (50 damage a hit, shown as numbers over the target); each leaves a drop, and the stage then puts the character beside the two drops to pick them up with F (two apples, then three more). Played as written on 2026-10-11: the apples held go 0, 2, 5. Prints: ST_READY, ST_SWING, ST_HIT slime damage, ST_DEAD place, ST_HOLD apples.",
